// The AIMask field option: the only thing that decides whether the chat
// agent masks a field. A field of a model annotated with it never reaches the
// LLM in clear text:
//
//   import "aimask.proto";
//   message Employee {
//     string national_id = 7 [(l8ai.AIMask) = true];
//     l8common.Address home_address = 8 [(l8ai.AIMask) = true];  // the whole message
//   }
//
// The agent replaces the value of an annotated field (a scalar, a list, a map
// or a whole nested message) in every tool result, and any aggregate over it,
// by a token stable within the conversation, and restores the value in the
// answer shown to the user, who is allowed to see it.
//
// Projects download this file next to their .proto files (like api.proto) and
// rewrite the generated "./types/l8ai" import to
// "github.com/saichler/l8ai/go/types/l8ai".

